## 3. Test Strategy

### 3.1 Test Levels

| Level | Scope | Owner | Tools |
|-------|-------|-------|-------|
| Unit | Individual functions | Learner | pytest |
| Integration | Component interactions | Learner | pytest |
| System | Full RAG pipeline | Learner | pytest + manual |

### 3.2 Test Types

| Type | Purpose | When Run |
|------|---------|----------|
| Functional | Verify features work | After each component |
| Negative | Handle bad inputs gracefully | With functional |
| Edge Case | Boundary conditions | With functional |
| Integration | Components work together | After component pairs |

